== 1. Own all-server vs hybrid, step by step: 5000 heavy developers, all their agent work on the open model, B300 nodes, 4 years
  Qwen3.8-27B:
    own realistic: GPU-s per session = prefill 11.0 + decode 24.8 + KV residency 21.3 = 57.1; GPUs at peak = 5000 x 5/h x 57.1 / 3600 x 2.0 = 794 -> 100 nodes; capex $66,000,000, opex $7,020,970/y, residual $13,200,000 -> $337/dev-month
    own ideal    : GPU-s per session = prefill 11.0 + decode 24.8 + KV residency 18.2 = 54.0; GPUs at peak = 5000 x 5/h x 54.0 / 3600 x 2.0 = 750 -> 94 nodes; capex $62,040,000, opex $6,599,712/y, residual $12,408,000 -> $317/dev-month
    hybrid: server GPU-s per session = 13.1 (prefill of every new and generated token); GPUs at peak 182 -> 23 nodes -> $78; KV store $12; egress $40 (remote only); Mac premium $4,200 x 65% / 48 = $57 -> $146 office / $186 remote per dev-month
    API: 27B API median $372, 27B API Alibaba $632, 27B API DeepInfra $285 per dev-month
  Flash-Next:
    own realistic: GPU-s per session = prefill 1.5 + decode 6.5 + KV residency 4.1 = 12.2; GPUs at peak = 5000 x 5/h x 12.2 / 3600 x 2.0 = 169 -> 22 nodes; capex $14,520,000, opex $1,544,613/y, residual $2,904,000 -> $74/dev-month
    own ideal    : GPU-s per session = prefill 1.5 + decode 6.5 + KV residency 2.9 = 10.9; GPUs at peak = 5000 x 5/h x 10.9 / 3600 x 2.0 = 152 -> 20 nodes; capex $13,200,000, opex $1,404,194/y, residual $2,640,000 -> $67/dev-month
    hybrid: server GPU-s per session = 1.8 (prefill of every new and generated token); GPUs at peak 26 -> 4 nodes -> $13; KV store $5; egress $13 (remote only); Mac premium $4,200 x 65% / 48 = $57 -> $75 office / $88 remote per dev-month
    API: Flash API (Alibaba) $134 per dev-month

